  "uncertain": [
    "J5/J6 labels are in separate 2x8 tables beside the headers with no leader lines; table-to-hole mapping (left column to left column, top row to top row) is an interpretation.",
    "Pin 1 taken from a tiny dot at top-left of each header; without it, the USB rule would start at the bottom end (micro-USB at bottom), and for J6 the outer row would be the right column."
